  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "**Explanation:**\n\nThe pattern followed in the given series is:\n\n **First term × 2 + Second term - 12 = Third term**\n\nNow we apply the pattern on the given sets:\n\n(18, 36, 60)\n\n__**18 **____**× 2**__ + 36 - 12 = 60\n\n__**36 + 36**__ - 12 = 60\n\n__**72 - 12**__ = 60\n\n60 = 60\n\n(14, 28, 44)\n\n__**14 **____**× 2**__ + 28 - 12 = 44\n\n__**28 **____**+ 28**__ - 12 = 44\n\n__**56 - 12 **__= 44\n\n44 = 44\n\nNow we apply the pattern on the given options:\n\nOption 1) (21, 42, 164)\n\n__21 ____× 2__ + 42 - 12 = 164\n\n__**42 + 42**__ - 12 = 164\n\n__**84 - 12**__ = 164\n\n72 ≠ 164\n\nOption 2) (17, 32, 60)\n\n__17 ____× 2__ + 32 - 12 = 60\n\n__34 + 32__ - 12 = 60\n\n__66 - 12__ = 60\n\n54 ≠ 60\n\nOption 3) (16, 28, 64)\n\n__16 ____× 2__ + 28 - 12 = 64\n\n__32 + 28__ - 12 = 64\n\n__60 - 12__ = 64\n\n48 ≠ 64\n\nOption 4) (22, 44, 76)\n\n__22 ____× 2__ + 44 - 12 = 76\n\n__44 + 44__ - 12 = 76\n\n__88 - 12__ = 76\n\n76 = 76\n\n**Hence the correct answer is option 4.**",
